---
title: signature_verification (EIP-7951)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> q_invert : s1 = s^(-1) (mod n)
    q_invert --> q_scalar1 : u1 = h * s1 (mod n)
    q_scalar1 --> q_scalar2 : u2 = r * s1 (mod n)
    q_scalar2 --> q_ecmul1 : P1 = u1 * G
    q_ecmul1 --> q_ecmul2 : P2 = u2 * (qx, qy)
    q_ecmul2 --> q_ecadd : R_prime = P1 + P2
    q_ecadd --> q_fail : R_prime is point at infinity
    q_ecadd --> q_extract : R_prime is not infinity
    q_extract --> q_compare : r_prime = R_prime.x
    q_compare --> q_success : r_prime == r (mod n)
    q_compare --> q_fail : r_prime != r (mod n)
    q_success --> [*] : return 0x01 (32 bytes)
    q_fail --> [*] : return empty

    note right of q_invert
        INV-009: s1 is modular inverse mod n, not mod p
    end note

    note right of q_ecadd
        INV-010: R_prime infinity check prevents non-deterministic behavior (RIP-7212 fix 1)
    end note

    note right of q_compare
        INV-011: Comparison uses modular reduction r_prime == r (mod n), not direct equality (RIP-7212 fix 2)
        INV-012: All scalar multiplications and additions are over secp256r1 group
    end note
